# Grafdigger's Cage and Crucible of Worlds: playing a land is putting it onto the battlefield (CR 305.1), so a land card
# a static ability keeps from entering can't be played (CR 101.2). Bot1 casts the Cage and the Crucible on turn 1, then
# Faithless Looting, discarding Dryad Arbor and Plains. Dryad Arbor is a creature card in the graveyard, so it can't be
# played from there; Plains, no creature card, is played from the graveyard: the land play the Cage leaves alone (the
# Cage's ruling).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Grafdigger's Cage
Crucible of Worlds
Faithless Looting
Swamp
Dryad Arbor
Plains
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grafdigger's Cage.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Crucible of Worlds.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Dryad Arbor; Plains)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Plains; Dryad Arbor; Black Lotus
! Bot1.Graveyard.Dryad Arbor.Play
Bot1.Graveyard.Plains.Play

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.LandsPlayed = 1
Bot1.Battlefield = Crucible of Worlds; Grafdigger's Cage; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Plains
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Dryad Arbor; Black Lotus
